{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "85ec0509-e94c-5f83-b600-6532696461ba", "source_ordinal": 2056, "reading_ordinal": 2000, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "好声音，坏声音", "published_at": "2023-08-24T18:17:22+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/618726356/answer/3180858108"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "其实我很奇怪为什么观众这么单纯。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这种由娱乐发展公司开办的、以发掘新人为目的的公开选秀节目，其基本意图从一开始就不是“无私的捧红最会唱歌的人”，而是“提前垄断下一代的偶像资源”，这才是对方的核心目的。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "选手的唱功只是极小、极次要的评价指标，主办公司综合考虑的利用价值才是真正的评价标准。", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 143}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "ta们非常清楚每一轮的晋级曝光机会都已经是重大投资，绝不可能等你全部赛完再来跟你谈签不签约，恰恰相反，相对公平的仅仅勉强是第一轮而已。", "char_start": 144, "char_end": 211}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "而且是第一轮还没有结束，在决定谁可以获得第二轮曝光投资之前，这些公司就会提前来找人签约。", "char_start": 212, "char_end": 256}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "不签个七八年，第二轮的机会绝不会浪费在你身上。ta们绝不会冒“亲手捧红千万粉丝新星，但却被对手公司签下”这种愚蠢的风险，这如同自掘坟墓。", "char_start": 257, "char_end": 325}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "也绝不会犯下“先自己花钱把你捧到千万身价，再来跟你谈判，哀求你签五六个月”这种低级错误。", "char_start": 326, "char_end": 370}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这就像你要收购一块地皮，你会先捐个二十亿给对方在上面先盖个东方明珠吗？这不是“脑子有没有进水”的问题，而是“脑子是不是本身就是水做的”的问题。", "char_start": 371, "char_end": 442}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "然而为什么这些企业不一开始就在规则里写上“只要你参赛，获胜就必须强制性和本公司签八年死约”呢？那还用问吗？这样写显然会缩小参与面，怎么保证获得最好的新人？得不到最好的新人，连收视率都保证不了，折腾这个干什么？闲得慌吗？", "char_start": 443, "char_end": 552}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "于是，一来二去，这件事最后就只有这一种游戏规则。", "char_start": 553, "char_end": 577}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "不要以为选手都是小羊羔，恰恰相反——如果娱乐公司不提前把约谈好，这些选手有极大的可能性在享受了几轮晋级后，自己主动炒作不和，提前“愤然退赛”。", "char_start": 578, "char_end": 649}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "到时候负面新闻全是主办方的，自己赚足人气和同情心，立足了“正义理想”的人设，还摆脱了一切潜在的香火情、江湖义理的羁绊（例如人家把你捧红，你却拿架子和对手签约），到时候这些娱乐公司就成了待宰的羔羊。", "char_start": 650, "char_end": 748}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你是不是觉得“年轻人思想没这么复杂”？", "char_start": 749, "char_end": 768}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "那么对手企业派出秘密代表，拿出合约来，暗地里给这些已经参赛三轮却没有签约的准决赛选手这种“你演好这出戏，我们给你五百万”的建议呢？", "char_start": 769, "char_end": 834}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "此事天知地知，你知我知，观众只会看到你的正义和不屈、我们的仗义相助和现在主办方的贪婪邪恶。而且这样我们就是同案犯，互相手握投名状，你也不必担心我会抛弃你，我也不必担心你有二心，大家以后亲密合作。", "char_start": 835, "char_end": 932}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "名、利、前途，一次性给你，永远不会有人知道我们的交易；你不做，我们就去找别人，给你一天时间考虑。", "char_start": 933, "char_end": 981}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你们想过主办方这个风险吗？", "char_start": 982, "char_end": 995}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "为什么这些娱乐节目都有这种“潜规则”？真的是“全员恶人”？", "char_start": 996, "char_end": 1025}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "总是拿“全员恶人”来解释自己看到的“黑暗事实”的人，最好听的评价也是“过于天真”。", "char_start": 1026, "char_end": 1067}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "不客气的说，其实是纵容自己的天真，放弃自己的思考责任。", "char_start": 1068, "char_end": 1095}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "一个行业如果“普遍黑暗”，对你而言第一反应应该是寻找背后的理性解释，而不是随手挥舞“全员恶人”的帽子解释一切，这是一种会直接导致大脑丧失基本功能的恶习。", "char_start": 1097, "char_end": 1173}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "现在，你自己先把上述的问题颠来倒去思考清楚，回答这几个问题：", "char_start": 1174, "char_end": 1204}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "第一，李玟是不是真的对show business的行业规律一无所知？", "char_start": 1205, "char_end": 1239}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "注意，这里没有完全排除这个可能性，李玟的确可能是为人极度童真，也许她真的是含着金汤匙出生，完全不清楚这些复杂的背后逻辑。", "char_start": 1240, "char_end": 1300}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "但是你自己不清楚是你的事，你能够仅仅因为你不清楚，勒令整个行业为你改个规则运行吗？", "char_start": 1301, "char_end": 1342}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "更何况，很难相信你来当评委的时候没有了解过赛制，如果你真的不能接受，应该从一开始就不参与，怎么能在参与了发现结果对自己不利之后再挑战赛制？也就是说结果如果让你满意，就不存在不公了吗？", "char_start": 1343, "char_end": 1434}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "这么操作，真的一点问题都没有、责任全在节目方吗？", "char_start": 1435, "char_end": 1459}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "何况，如果一切皆如你所愿，你负责补偿投资人的损失吗？你负责保证ta们的生存和盈利吗？", "char_start": 1461, "char_end": 1503}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "如果你不负责、不保证，那么你的天真浪漫只会得到无情的回应——因为你是在一片天真的逼人去死，和一个小孩在日本兵正在洞口搜索时大声质疑“凭什么我这么难过了还不准我哭”一样——在你看来你完全无辜，但是在村民看来，不好意思，捂到你断气也得把你捂住。", "char_start": 1504, "char_end": 1624}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "是你的天真要为残酷的现实让路，是你自己有不天真的义务，而不是残酷的现实有义务要成全你的“纯真”。", "char_start": 1625, "char_end": 1673}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "哪怕“残酷的现实”自己心里一万个愿意，ta也没这个能力去配合你的演出。", "char_start": 1674, "char_end": 1709}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "为什么李玟这事出来了，圈内人士集体噤声，宁可低调等待热潮过去？", "char_start": 1710, "char_end": 1741}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "真的是背后的势力“手眼通天”？", "char_start": 1742, "char_end": 1757}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "这又是一种“为了回避一切思考成本，所以直接采信最廉价的不可证伪解释”的恶习发作。阴谋论者在这个问题上和那些没能力做实验，一切都用“妖魔作祟”“鬼上身”来解释的愚夫愚妇没有本质区别。", "char_start": 1758, "char_end": 1848}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "那是为什么？", "char_start": 1849, "char_end": 1855}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "那是为了保全自己的客户寄托在李玟身上的天真幻想，避免这整个行业的客户过于关注那些煞风景的现实。", "char_start": 1856, "char_end": 1903}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "这就像如果可以选择，魔术师们绝不愿接什么“魔术揭秘”的茬一样——哪怕是只是告诉你“不是你猜的这样”，都会折损你下次买票的概率。", "char_start": 1904, "char_end": 1967}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "受委屈和砸饭碗二选一，只有儿童会选砸饭碗。", "char_start": 1968, "char_end": 1989}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "ta们宁肯保全你们对于“这类节目是为了选拔能力好的新人的无私平台”的幻想，以开除掉一批具体的替罪羊为“代价”，情绪性的抹平你们的落差感，通过让你们寄望于一批新主创的方式维持你们对这些节目的美好憧憬，也不愿真的把这背后的冰冷逻辑揭穿。", "char_start": 1990, "char_end": 2106}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "那样是会少受委屈，但是揭穿了以后大家都会知道这类节目不是只看才艺，那还怎么保持收视率？", "char_start": 2107, "char_end": 2150}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "第二点提醒各位——不要以为那些选手都是洁白无辜的小绵羊。这个群体无不以在娱乐圈出人头地为人生赌注，哪怕ta们自己不知道这些背后的规则，只要稍微崭露头角，这些话都会有纷至沓来的星探话赶话说给ta们听——这种谈话干脆就会是以“你听我给你揭穿另一位星探的诡计”的形式开始。", "char_start": 2152, "char_end": 2285}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "你揭我的底来作为“真诚的证明”，我揭ta的底作为“诚意的表示”，三下五除二，除非这位新人真的智力有障碍，否则白痴也会被这些拆开揉碎的“我是真的替你考虑”来个彻底的震撼教育。", "char_start": 2286, "char_end": 2372}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "这种教育会极其迅速的撕下一切温情面纱，途经赤裸裸的天价合约诱惑，直奔“请您提前卖身 / 大闹天宫交上投名状”这种实质的歃血为盟而去。", "char_start": 2373, "char_end": 2439}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "ta们要生存，这是老天爷给show business划定的生存现实，由不得ta们温情脉脉。", "char_start": 2440, "char_end": 2485}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "换言之，选手们对“这不是一个纯才艺问题”不太可能是一无所知，ta们（或至少相当一部分人）对节目的“黑暗”不太可能真的像ta们看上去的那么“惊讶”和“悲愤”。", "char_start": 2486, "char_end": 2564}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "这才是这件事背后更可能的实际真相。", "char_start": 2565, "char_end": 2582}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "第三个问题是——这么多大V，是不是真的全都不知道这些？", "char_start": 2584, "char_end": 2611}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "如果ta们的悲愤居然是货真价实的，那么你要慎重的考虑ta是不是真的有足够的思考习惯，在情绪之外还能给你更多实在的有效参考。", "char_start": 2612, "char_end": 2673}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "人生不是只有情绪和情绪的满足。", "char_start": 2674, "char_end": 2689}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "恰恰相反，这对成人——尤其是自觉意识到自己最少对自己的家庭要承担至少部分领导责任的成年人，是最次要的事。", "char_start": 2690, "char_end": 2742}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "任何社会新闻甚至任何见闻的发生，成年人考虑的首要问题应该是这里面有哪些可以榨取的情报。", "char_start": 2743, "char_end": 2786}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "石头也要能攥成粉、逼出油，给块石墨都要握出钻石。", "char_start": 2787, "char_end": 2811}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "这才是重点。", "char_start": 2812, "char_end": 2818}, {"paragraph_id": "P054", "field": "body", "index": 54, "text": "现在，请问这事发生了这么多天，你除了“义愤填膺”“世界黑暗”这种心理创伤之外，有什么别的收获？", "char_start": 2819, "char_end": 2866}, {"paragraph_id": "P055", "field": "body", "index": 55, "text": "没有的话，去墙角站半小时！给自己一个教训！", "char_start": 2867, "char_end": 2888}, {"paragraph_id": "P056", "field": "body", "index": 56, "text": "最后，不能不补上这一段。", "char_start": 2890, "char_end": 2902}, {"paragraph_id": "P057", "field": "body", "index": 57, "text": "录一期节目，几百人陪着、几支团队围着、上千平米的演播厅租着，个把小时的播出档期给你留着，你拦住拍摄一小时，这是几百个人的一小时薪资。", "char_start": 2903, "char_end": 2969}, {"paragraph_id": "P058", "field": "body", "index": 58, "text": "薪资倒也罢了，今天的拍摄计划没能完成，要多租半天场地、要所有的嘉宾全部多临时抽出额外半天时间，这些嘉宾签了约的其他通告怎么办？交违约金吗？谁来交？", "char_start": 2970, "char_end": 3043}, {"paragraph_id": "P059", "field": "body", "index": 59, "text": "这个损失谁来承担？", "char_start": 3044, "char_end": 3053}, {"paragraph_id": "P060", "field": "body", "index": 60, "text": "节目下周就要播出、如此沉重的后期制作任务、播前审查流程，足足少了一天的工作时间，多少人要彻夜加班追进度？这些加班费谁出？", "char_start": 3054, "char_end": 3114}, {"paragraph_id": "P061", "field": "body", "index": 61, "text": "这显然都是一流团队，档期都是挤得死死的，人家还要供房供娃，手上的单子接得满满当当，你该送素材的时候没送达，人家后面有别的安排，对后面的合约是违约还是在做别的已经满负荷的前提下再把你这制作挤进去？", "char_start": 3115, "char_end": 3212}, {"paragraph_id": "P062", "field": "body", "index": 62, "text": "你肯定会跪地哀求我加班，你也是老兄弟，当初也对我有知遇之恩，我怎么能不帮你？于是我是不是只能为你多熬几夜，拿命顶？", "char_start": 3213, "char_end": 3270}, {"paragraph_id": "P063", "field": "body", "index": 63, "text": "我这顶掉的命，谁负责？", "char_start": 3271, "char_end": 3282}, {"paragraph_id": "P064", "field": "body", "index": 64, "text": "实话实说，出于个人情绪大闹片场，这在业内属于不可饶恕、不可容忍的重大错误，是没有借口的。特技演员摔到重伤送ICU急救，只要进度能继续推进，也是救护车一走立刻继续开机的。这不是无情，是你自己不能拿无情的帽子往大家身上套、否则无情的是你。", "char_start": 3284, "char_end": 3401}, {"paragraph_id": "P065", "field": "body", "index": 65, "text": "岂能随你一发火来就占住台子不放？你还“不许动我”？", "char_start": 3402, "char_end": 3427}, {"paragraph_id": "P066", "field": "body", "index": 66, "text": "但凡有一点制作经验的人、看到这个画面都知道李玟是有重大过失的，她有什么理由在这个行为面前都是说不过去的。", "char_start": 3428, "char_end": 3480}, {"paragraph_id": "P067", "field": "body", "index": 67, "text": "她做了这事，无论哪个团队都不可能再冒这种要命的风险——不错，对档期追着脖子飞的电视节目制作，这是绝不能再冒的险。你是大明星，你大不了怄怄气过去了，你一年几千万你无所谓。", "char_start": 3481, "char_end": 3565}, {"paragraph_id": "P068", "field": "body", "index": 68, "text": "我是剧务、是副导演、是现场监制，在我手里出了一个开天窗的重大事故，没人会跟我说“哎呀，这个演员太不好伺候，不能怪你”。", "char_start": 3566, "char_end": 3625}, {"paragraph_id": "P069", "field": "body", "index": 69, "text": "狗屁，哪个演员明星好伺候？我吃的就是不好伺候也能摆平的饭，摆不平就是绝对责任无借口可言。", "char_start": 3626, "char_end": 3670}, {"paragraph_id": "P070", "field": "body", "index": 70, "text": "这也是为什么“不耍大牌”是成名艺人最重要的口碑，“不让下面人难做”是最基本的艺德，也是为什么“the show must go on, no matter what”是铁一般的职业操守。", "char_start": 3671, "char_end": 3764}, {"paragraph_id": "P071", "field": "body", "index": 71, "text": "李玟是有抑郁症，是出于善良的愿望，是有名望，这在制作方看来，一旦发生这种事就全是缺点——等于你痛快大闹一场，所有真金白银、流血流汗的后果全部都要我们买单，我们还不能多说你一句，加班追赶丢了半条命，亏钱亏了一裤子、名声被你毁到这样，还要向你赔礼道歉。", "char_start": 3766, "char_end": 3890}, {"paragraph_id": "P072", "field": "body", "index": 72, "text": "这种经历，请问圈内谁想再试第二次？", "char_start": 3891, "char_end": 3908}, {"paragraph_id": "P073", "field": "body", "index": 73, "text": "这样的事情发生了，你不但意识不到给合作伙伴造成了多么沉重的损失，还完完全全地认为自己完全无辜，对方是邪魔、是恶棍，是活该。", "char_start": 3909, "char_end": 3970}, {"paragraph_id": "P074", "field": "body", "index": 74, "text": "谁愿意再冒一次人财两失、死里逃生还身败名裂的险？", "char_start": 3971, "char_end": 3995}, {"paragraph_id": "P075", "field": "body", "index": 75, "text": "于是你的通告就立刻清零了，你找谁来帮你“实现音乐梦想”，谁也不敢再来当下一个“阻挡中国音乐发展”的“历史罪人”了。", "char_start": 3996, "char_end": 4053}, {"paragraph_id": "P076", "field": "body", "index": 76, "text": "出了事没人会听恶魔说嘛，都站在你那边，不是吗？越辩解越不是人，不是吗？", "char_start": 4054, "char_end": 4089}, {"paragraph_id": "P077", "field": "body", "index": 77, "text": "这样的事，你们这些围着骂的，谁要来试试？", "char_start": 4090, "char_end": 4110}, {"paragraph_id": "P078", "field": "body", "index": 78, "text": "为什么重度抑郁患者处境危险？因为一旦有任何矛盾，人们极其容易因为同情把全部的道义倾斜给ta，搞得“逼迫”者鸡飞蛋打，身败名裂。", "char_start": 4112, "char_end": 4175}, {"paragraph_id": "P079", "field": "body", "index": 79, "text": "你儿子得了重度抑郁，你这当爹的、当妈的、当老师的、当兄弟的、当女友的……个个都必然是“在ta极度脆弱的状态下还不依不饶的恶魔”，你们这恶人当定了，你们别想狡辩了。", "char_start": 4177, "char_end": 4258}, {"paragraph_id": "P080", "field": "body", "index": 80, "text": "有得跑吗？这是逻辑必然、“不问可知”的“事实”吧？你看看受害者那声嘶力竭的求救声，不可怜吗？让ta变成这样的人还有可能有“哪怕一丝良知”吗？", "char_start": 4259, "char_end": 4329}, {"paragraph_id": "P081", "field": "body", "index": 81, "text": "好吧，那好吧，我投降了，我不是人，我是恶魔。", "char_start": 4330, "char_end": 4352}, {"paragraph_id": "P082", "field": "body", "index": 82, "text": "行，我认栽了。", "char_start": 4353, "char_end": 4360}, {"paragraph_id": "P083", "field": "body", "index": 83, "text": "我什么也不说了。", "char_start": 4361, "char_end": 4369}, {"paragraph_id": "P084", "field": "body", "index": 84, "text": "你们来吧，你们谁来帮她“实现音乐梦想”啊？", "char_start": 4370, "char_end": 4391}, {"paragraph_id": "P085", "field": "body", "index": 85, "text": "好人真好当，是吗？那你们为什么不当？", "char_start": 4392, "char_end": 4410}, {"paragraph_id": "P086", "field": "body", "index": 86, "text": "大家都学乖了，都知道替你谴责“前恶魔”，但是前恶魔的人头挂在城门上，谁要来当新天使？", "char_start": 4412, "char_end": 4454}, {"paragraph_id": "P087", "field": "body", "index": 87, "text": "对于重度抑郁患者是什么样的净结果？", "char_start": 4456, "char_end": 4473}, {"paragraph_id": "P088", "field": "body", "index": 88, "text": "——是在刚刚受到最沉重的打击后，在世界的一片“赞扬”“同情”声中，被实际的、彻底的抛弃了。", "char_start": 4474, "char_end": 4519}, {"paragraph_id": "P089", "field": "body", "index": 89, "text": "这种抛弃甚至比一片骂声、千夫所指的抛弃更让人绝望。", "char_start": 4520, "char_end": 4545}, {"paragraph_id": "P090", "field": "body", "index": 90, "text": "如果世界对我是一片骂声，那么我还可以指望我改了点什么，可以得到不那么孤立的结果。", "char_start": 4546, "char_end": 4586}, {"paragraph_id": "P091", "field": "body", "index": 91, "text": "但现在世界对我是一片赞扬，说得我没有任何做错的地方。", "char_start": 4587, "char_end": 4613}, {"paragraph_id": "P092", "field": "body", "index": 92, "text": "但我没有任何做错的地方，我要做的事却根本做不成，没有哪怕一个人要来加入，我要不要绝望？", "char_start": 4614, "char_end": 4657}, {"paragraph_id": "P093", "field": "body", "index": 93, "text": "是谁抛弃了我？是居然胆大包天敢赌一赌成功概率的“前恶魔”，还是这些自己绝不会出头伸手的“天使唱诗班”们？", "char_start": 4658, "char_end": 4710}, {"paragraph_id": "P094", "field": "body", "index": 94, "text": "我知道这些话说了一定会引来“万众讨伐”，你们放心，我对此毫无侥幸。", "char_start": 4711, "char_end": 4744}, {"paragraph_id": "P095", "field": "body", "index": 95, "text": "但是为了下一个“李玟”不要重复这一条轨迹，你们来吧。", "char_start": 4745, "char_end": 4771}, {"paragraph_id": "P096", "field": "body", "index": 96, "text": "如果你同情李玟，要把这些话看作她为你们带来的最值得珍惜的礼物。", "char_start": 4772, "char_end": 4803}, {"paragraph_id": "P097", "field": "body", "index": 97, "text": "这是拿命换的。", "char_start": 4804, "char_end": 4811}, {"paragraph_id": "P098", "field": "body", "index": 98, "text": "不要责怪邮递员。", "char_start": 4812, "char_end": 4820}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 109}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0298"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么好声音敢这样对待李玟？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053", "P054", "P055", "P056", "P057", "P058", "P059", "P060", "P061", "P062", "P063", "P064", "P065", "P066", "P067", "P068", "P069", "P070", "P071", "P072", "P073", "P074", "P075", "P076", "P077", "P078", "P079", "P080", "P081", "P082", "P083", "P084", "P085", "P086", "P087", "P088", "P089", "P090", "P091", "P092", "P093", "P094", "P095", "P096", "P097", "P098"], "summary": "围绕“好声音，坏声音”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“其实我很奇怪为什么观众这么单纯。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "其实我很奇怪为什么观众这么单纯。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "9cbdfc98-e00b-5fe8-907a-92ee6d25e4af", "source_ordinal": 2055, "reading_ordinal": 2001, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "博士伦", "published_at": "2023-08-25T03:17:07+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/291597382/answer/3181365568"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "博士应该逃离的不是科研，而是特定的人生困境。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不要错误地定性。定性错了，整个问题就错了，而错误的问题已经预定了错误的答案，后面都是注定的一条死路。", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "什么叫特定的人生困境？", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "我们开一开上帝视角，飞到二三十年后俯视整条时间线，你会发现一件非常可怕的悲剧——", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 126}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你所选择的第一项事业、你的第一个雄心壮志，大概率是会以你自己心灰意冷甚至愤懑绝望告终的。得到这个结局的时候，你是三百六十度全身心地这样认为的，没有一点点怀疑的。", "char_start": 127, "char_end": 207}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但是到了二三十年后，你会发现——其实事情根本就没有你那时以为的那么严重。当时你所认定十恶不赦、如同邪魔化身的“敌人”、“小人”，其实根本就没有你想的那么可怕。甚至更悲剧——对方何止没有“针对你”，甚至干脆实际上是站在你这一边的。", "char_start": 208, "char_end": 322}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "问题的真正症结，根本就不是你当时笃信无疑的所谓“烂透了、根本没希望”，那只是你当时既无知、又傲慢，既迷茫、又自负所催生出来的一个你必须要拿到的、唯一可以保护你自己那些虚荣和脆弱的借口、幻觉而已。", "char_start": 323, "char_end": 420}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你的第一份事业（有人甚至是第二、第三份都要被卷入）只是非常不幸地发生在这样一个被诅咒的时段罢了。", "char_start": 421, "char_end": 469}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "在这个时段里，其实你选了什么，包括你自己自以为“完全没有类似问题”的所谓“正确的选择”，都不会改变这个结果。", "char_start": 470, "char_end": 524}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "真正导致你失败的，是你当时追求事业的整个mindset，那一整个极易猜疑、极易生忌、极易记恨，却极难调解、极难宽容、极难释怀的mindset。", "char_start": 525, "char_end": 596}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "哪里是什么“绝无可能”，其实把那份工干出成绩的人也不是一个两个，真正绝无可能的是当时那个不识轻重、反认得失的心。", "char_start": 597, "char_end": 653}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "人家给你的提醒，被你认为是耻笑；人家给你的指正，被你以为是凌辱。越想越真，越真越想，直到深入骨髓，积重难返，势不两立。", "char_start": 654, "char_end": 713}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "第一份事业、乃至第一个爱人、第一群伙伴，只是为这第一层心障做了磨石、随之凋谢了罢了。", "char_start": 714, "char_end": 756}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "而这问题，对一般人来说虽然感慨，但却多半可以称为人生回忆，但在“博士科研”这个问题上却糟糕了。", "char_start": 757, "char_end": 804}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "因为博士们做第一份事业时，相当多人是真没机会先去社会里历一番沉浮，先拿什么“销售工作”“客服工作”来给这份少不更事做陪葬磨刀石的——抬脚第一步，就是科研，一支付“年轻的代价”，结果就成“逃离科研”了。", "char_start": 805, "char_end": 905}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "把这话点明，是为了希望多少有几个青年的博士思考这种现实的风险——如果你读博士的同时自觉地、不懈地坚持心理上的自我建设，会大大地有利于你撑过这一关。", "char_start": 906, "char_end": 979}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这甚至可能不是一个“可选项”，可以等你心情已经陷入焦虑后再去考虑。当你已经陷入焦虑，你的防御心态是极度强烈的，你还是个能言善辩的博士，马力全开可以轻松地、头头是道地把天下一切道理全部拒之门外。", "char_start": 980, "char_end": 1076}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这层保护要在你心情放松、还有足够幽默感时就着手，此时是事半功倍的。", "char_start": 1077, "char_end": 1110}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "如果你觉得条件有限，那么盯住我的内容，这几千篇也好歹可以先给你顶一顶。", "char_start": 1111, "char_end": 1146}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这事不应轻视，最好重视起来。", "char_start": 1147, "char_end": 1161}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "聪明的人并不见得比愚蠢的人容易想得开——因为作为自己的敌人，聪明人也狡猾得可怕。", "char_start": 1162, "char_end": 1202}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0298"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么越来越多博士逃离科研？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021"], "summary": "围绕“博士伦”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“博士应该逃离的不是科研，而是特定的人生困境。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "博士应该逃离的不是科研，而是特定的人生困境。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "3b4f37bf-f4e1-5ae3-adb1-db75085d592a", "source_ordinal": 2054, "reading_ordinal": 2002, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "大金砖", "published_at": "2023-08-25T05:36:34+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/618935027/answer/3181390765"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有这么一种非常朴素的道理——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "人类过过没有手机电脑，只有卫生纸、切菜刀、棉布和大衣柜的日子，但是人类没有过过只有手机电脑，却没有卫生纸、切菜刀、棉布和大衣柜的日子。到目前为止，后一种社会形态还没有数学上的可行解。", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 106}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这是什么意思呢？", "char_start": 107, "char_end": 115}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "意思是第三世界国家如果可以团结，能在物质性资源和产品上凭借天然的禀赋优势获得压倒性的市场优势，那么这份有实在物理基础的优势，是要胜过仅仅掌握文学艺术、知识计算这类虚拟领域的优势的。", "char_start": 116, "char_end": 206}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "“制造业强大、资源丰厚而科技、文化稍逊一筹”与“制造业孱弱、资源匮乏但是科技、文化稍胜一筹”，并不是“对称的优势”。", "char_start": 207, "char_end": 265}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "事实上，是前一种优势更有决定性。", "char_start": 266, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这是世界的客观规律。", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 293}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "唯一的问题是：要凝聚前一种优势，在组织上有更大的难度。", "char_start": 294, "char_end": 321}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "少数富国要比大量的发展中国家更容易协调行动，这就像两家大超市要比八家便利店容易结盟一样，也是客观规律。", "char_start": 322, "char_end": 373}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "如果第三世界国家能摸索出某种机制解决这个“八家便利店连锁”的问题，这八家便利店是一定可以赢过那两家大超市的。", "char_start": 374, "char_end": 428}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "金砖国家的成员扩张，就是在摸索和验证这个要害。", "char_start": 429, "char_end": 452}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这是真正釜底抽薪的底层解决，是可以摊在桌子上当面进行的阳谋。", "char_start": 453, "char_end": 483}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "对方一定会拼了命地作梗，因为这绝非那种“今天你赢一局，明天我赢一局”的战术性打闹。", "char_start": 484, "char_end": 525}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这是类似当年提出公有制来挑战私有制一样的革旧鼎新，是要彻底地换一个秩序、换一个国际法则。", "char_start": 526, "char_end": 570}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "相比之下，俄乌、台海，都只是一时一地的细节问题而已。", "char_start": 571, "char_end": 597}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "我们是在见证历史。", "char_start": 598, "char_end": 607}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 16}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0298"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：阿根廷、埃及、埃塞俄比亚、伊朗、沙特阿拉伯、阿联酋获邀加入金砖国家合作机制，金砖国家扩员有怎样的意义？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“大金砖”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有这么一种非常朴素的道理——”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有这么一种非常朴素的道理——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "23b81fa0-b871-535e-a523-e59dcf36dd23", "source_ordinal": 2053, "reading_ordinal": 2003, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "共识的逻辑", "published_at": "2023-08-25T16:45:09+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/618879754/answer/3182304977"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "影响大概是这样的：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "1）调查结果大概率会是“提前由叛国内奸 / 间谍 安装的定时炸弹制造的刺杀”。", "char_start": 10, "char_end": 49}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "肩扛导弹要射击巡航高度的喷气式客机是很难的，本来高度就太高，稍微站偏一点就根本无法锁定。哪有这么刚好正站在航线下？所以肩扛导弹射击都是直接蹲在机场围墙边射击起飞降落的飞机。", "char_start": 50, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "如果是战术防空导弹拿来射击这种小型商务机，恐怕破坏会比这个严重得多。何况如果要动到战术导弹，那根本不如收买地勤做点手脚，甚至干脆在某个旅途中搞路边炸弹，推给SBU，防空导弹有一整条指挥链，最起码一整个乘员组，知情人也太多了，这种搞法实在是奇葩得匪夷所思。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 264}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "威力足够、执行可靠、操作性强而且不受航线变更影响的手段几乎只有定时炸弹。因为炸弹只要一装好，当事人就已经可以提前跑路，等爆炸了人已经出国了。甚至不管炸没炸，都有很大机会保住自己的命，实属首选方案。", "char_start": 265, "char_end": 363}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "所以这很可能的确也是真相。", "char_start": 364, "char_end": 377}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "2）死后备极哀荣，甚至可能国葬。普京等领导人会发表复仇宣言。号召全体军民清醒意识到敌人的不择手段和恶毒以及俄罗斯民族现在面对的仇恨，必须抛弃一切妥协和仁慈的幻想，彻底消灭敌人，让敌人为每一次挑衅付出足够沉重的代价。", "char_start": 379, "char_end": 486}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "3）可能会对被认定的责任方发动报复性的暗杀，甚至可能会宣布一个名单。对乌克兰基础设施再次实施打击，重新把乌克兰打回基本停电状态。", "char_start": 487, "char_end": 551}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "4）在北线加紧攻势。", "char_start": 552, "char_end": 562}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "5）进一步军事支持尼日尔，派遣更多部队和装备前往尼日尔。尤其是宣布运送大量防空导弹和反装甲导弹给尼日尔。帮助尼日尔构建坚固工事。", "char_start": 563, "char_end": 627}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "其实，事实是否真的是这样，俄罗斯上下可能根本就不关心，只要这个结论最有利于下一步局势发展，受害人全部在境外而且基本都是已经明确的敌人，各方就都可以纷纷表示“实情就是如此”。", "char_start": 628, "char_end": 714}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这听起来很“黑暗”，但这却是人类遇到这类问题时的标准应激机制。", "char_start": 715, "char_end": 746}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "实际上最后被确认的“真相”的决定性因素往往并不是所谓的证据或者逻辑——那只会将备选答案略微限缩范围，例如要求最后的故事必需要能解释为什么飞机这样爆炸，而不能离谱到“根本没有发生爆炸”。", "char_start": 747, "char_end": 839}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "但在“足以解释基本情节”这条及格线之上，还有着从黑到白、从红到绿、从一缕青烟到重金属的无数个可选版本。", "char_start": 840, "char_end": 891}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "真正决定是哪个版本被高举到“最终结论”位置的，并不是科学——科学只决定了候选资格（甚至有时都不见得能决定候选资格，比如机械摘棉机就没有说服那些加拿大议员）——而是zz。", "char_start": 892, "char_end": 976}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这是一个很重要的规律，无视它的人很容易会陷入强烈的精神痛苦之中，因为会很容易由此产生“暗无天日”、“沉冤莫白”这类的绝望感。", "char_start": 977, "char_end": 1039}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "问题是，不管你怎么看待这种安排，这种安排也不是人类自己可以“超越”的，而是人类社会运转的自然规律的一部分。", "char_start": 1040, "char_end": 1093}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "“社会共识的形成和演变机制”是一门冷静而客观的自然法则，而不是一种可以任人点菜拒收的订单式服务。你只能在清醒认识到这规则的基础上去寻求最好的结果。", "char_start": 1094, "char_end": 1167}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这就像病毒感染，你能选择的只有了解它的生理机制，想办法用药物或者其他手段干预它的发展进程来寻求不同的事情结果，而不是去咒骂它“邪恶”、痛斥它“凶残”来解决问题。", "char_start": 1168, "char_end": 1248}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "后者几乎注定会以在九死一生的抑郁中备受折磨——如果在九死一生之际能及时悔改自己的态度的话。", "char_start": 1249, "char_end": 1294}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0298"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：瓦格纳创始人普里戈任坠机身亡，是否会极大影响俄乌局势？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“共识的逻辑”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“影响大概是这样的：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "影响大概是这样的：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d345dfad-efbe-5dd8-ad4d-4bc095c30d26", "source_ordinal": 2052, "reading_ordinal": 2004, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "体感拳皇", "published_at": "2023-08-25T23:56:11+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/302658540/answer/3182839756"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "失望的前提是，你自己不创造利益，一看自己的账户里是0，然后发现“一切都是利益”你当然慌了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 45}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你要是一伸手就能从帽子里掏只兔子，一听说“人与人之间的关系本质上是利益关系”，自然就大喜过望了。", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 94}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你失望的根源不是利益关系问题，而是觉得掏不出兔子。", "char_start": 95, "char_end": 120}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你看张三每天就拿个碗要饭，他也会一开口唱个莲花落，歌颂老爷太太人美心善，吉祥如意，他还会自觉的把人店门口的交通锥摆正。", "char_start": 121, "char_end": 180}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "他这就已经算是只巴掌大的小兔子了，已经可以换到一碗咸菜粥了。", "char_start": 181, "char_end": 211}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "换言之，人与人的关系的确是利益关系，但利益关系有成千上万种满足的方式，其中不知有几千几万种是只有动动嘴就能做到的。", "char_start": 212, "char_end": 269}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你有兔子，你能拽出兔子，拽出兔子没你想的那么难。“人与人之间关系的本质是利益”是利好消息，是降低了你的生存难度的【好安排】。", "char_start": 270, "char_end": 332}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你不应该为此感到失望、绝望，而应该感到安慰、感到振奋和庆幸。", "char_start": 333, "char_end": 363}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "只要你停止把“创造出价值”偷换成“创造出让人惊叹、跪求的价值”、停止认为“只有让人腿软的奇迹才有价值”，停止说“只是句拍马屁的话”这类昏话，扎扎实实的去学一点最大众、最基本的劳动技能，你立刻会发现人类真的是很好相处的——你给ta随便一点什么实在的收获，就算态度不咋好，人家都一样笑嘻嘻。", "char_start": 364, "char_end": 507}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你非要这个世界把规则变成“人与人之间的关系和利益无关”，这个游戏只会变得更难玩，更容易game over——甚至根本就没法玩了。", "char_start": 508, "char_end": 572}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "客观上，你是因为搓不出连招，打着滚要官方把拳皇改成体感操作。官方拒绝你还要罢玩，要寄刀片——体感操作得累死你个肥宅。", "char_start": 573, "char_end": 631}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "不要搞反了正反面。", "char_start": 632, "char_end": 641}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 12}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0298"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：人与人之间的关系本质上是利益关系，知道这句话后对社会彻底失望怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“体感拳皇”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“失望的前提是，你自己不创造利益，一看自己的账户里是0，然后发现“一切都是利益”你当然慌了。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "失望的前提是，你自己不创造利益，一看自己的账户里是0，然后发现“一切都是利益”你当然慌了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 45, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "14b4724f-23f0-5e23-a446-bb00ec49e590", "source_ordinal": 2051, "reading_ordinal": 2005, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "浅不可测", "published_at": "2023-08-26T04:08:37+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/27583188/answer/3182956145"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "我对人的洞察力，你们应该心里有数，然而我从不觉得能“测”出哪个人的“深”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "人是不可测度的事物，任何自认为测出了谁的深度的念头都只不过是一种自欺欺人。", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 75}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "区别并不是谁深度比较浅或者谁眼光比较好，而是在两个人之间发生了什么，让一个人竟然敢于持有“测出了深度”的幻觉而不引起本能的恐慌。你有某种因素能导致对方一旦产生这种自信自己就会担忧害怕，ta就会对你作出“深不可测”的评价。", "char_start": 76, "char_end": 186}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "比如，你曾经以某种超出ta意料的策略击溃过某种侵犯。ta自我代入敌人的角色，自认如果是ta，也无法预料到你这超常的手段，他就会评价你为“深不可测”。", "char_start": 187, "char_end": 261}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "因为这时ta会对安全感本身感到不安全。", "char_start": 262, "char_end": 281}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你只需要极少的几个战绩、见证，就能造成这种效应。", "char_start": 282, "char_end": 306}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "问题是，你怎么知道你对任何一个人拥有的这种安全感不是另一个暗藏风暴的平静假象呢？", "char_start": 307, "char_end": 347}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你为什么只敬畏那些已经有过战绩记录的，而相信其他人与这人肯定不同？", "char_start": 348, "char_end": 381}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你只觉得有部分人是深不可测的，而以为有谁不是（甚至是大部分人都不是），这是非常危险的错误认知，建议尽快改正。", "char_start": 382, "char_end": 436}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为何止深不可测，浅也不可测。", "char_start": 437, "char_end": 452}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0298"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：你遇到过哪些深不可测的人？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“浅不可测”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“我对人的洞察力，你们应该心里有数，然而我从不觉得能“测”出哪个人的“深”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "我对人的洞察力，你们应该心里有数，然而我从不觉得能“测”出哪个人的“深”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "61a9b576-8376-5a3c-88dd-06b73ae25f0c", "source_ordinal": 2050, "reading_ordinal": 2006, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "皆大欢喜", "published_at": "2023-08-27T02:45:40+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/c1396a3a444011ee86845254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "急救可能按断肋骨，而且很可能按断肋骨也救不活，概率甚至不小。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "有按断了肋骨也没能救活的实际案例，有名有姓、实实在在的事实。", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 61}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "当你发病，你的朋友正准备打电话，邻居跟ta说“救不救得到再说，大半要断肋骨”“那个手法我训练的时候试过，疼的我嗷嗷叫，我差点喘不上气”。", "char_start": 62, "char_end": 130}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "说的确实是实话。", "char_start": 131, "char_end": 139}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "所以你的朋友就没打电话。", "char_start": 140, "char_end": 152}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这位朋友并没有什么罪责，这是确定无疑的。", "char_start": 153, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "说这话的邻居也没啥责任，这也是确定无疑的。", "char_start": 174, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "没准你在地上躺了两个小时，自己缓过来了。这当然也有可能。", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 224}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "如果确实如此，那么净结果是ta们可能拯救了你的肋骨，免了你一次无谓的伤害。", "char_start": 225, "char_end": 262}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "如果是这样，那当然最好，皆大欢喜。", "char_start": 263, "char_end": 280}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "——如果确实是这样的话。", "char_start": 281, "char_end": 293}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "https://www.zhihu.com/collection/913519589", "char_start": 294, "char_end": 336}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 12}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0298"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：想转发这些答案到朋友圈，但是有很多人说有问题，怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“皆大欢喜”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“急救可能按断肋骨，而且很可能按断肋骨也救不活，概率甚至不小。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "急救可能按断肋骨，而且很可能按断肋骨也救不活，概率甚至不小。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
